OL,3,GNEWSAHouseholds could need extra bin in
OL,4,Arecycling shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds could need an extra
OL,7,Frecycling bin after a major shake-up of
OL,8,Fcollections was approved.
OL,10,FPaper and cardboard will have to be
OL,11,Fkept separate from other household
OL,12,Frecycling under the new system.
OL,14,FHampshire County Council approved the
OL,15,Fplans on 2 November, despite concerns
OL,16,Ffrom five district and borough councils
OL,17,Fabout the cost and practicality.
OL,19,FThe county council says the change will
OL,20,Fsave money in the long run, and is
OL,21,Fneeded to make the most of a new #50.5m
OL,22,Frecycling centre in Eastleigh.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
